 href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/32/59/fc/3259fc753a6111faaa64dee4f176c5e9.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">The house:</a><br /> You are almost out of gas, gps battery is down, there is no signal on your phone. You are lost in the middle of nowhere.<br /> You drive a few more miles and find a big old house. All the green vegetation has disappeared, the surroundings of the house and every leaf and twig is gray.<br /> It's a big country house where an old sympathetic man lives.<br /> The old man often offer a warm bed and food for people who are lost. He always claims that are trying to fix the phone but it is just a pretext to make anyone stay longer in the house.<br /> The old man drug their victims with the food offered. His victims are tied to an iron bed in the basement and when they wake up they already lost a llimb or two. Time passes and the wounds are treated and stitched. He tries increasingly to socialize with the victim. First he feeds them with serum, then he makes a soup with the remains of the body parts of the victim.<br /> After all the psychological and torture the old man likes to see them suffer. He involves their naked bodies without limbs with barbed wire until their bodies no longer withstand the loss of blood. After death he consumes their bodies making a well made food in the oven and feeds the next lost guest.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/roadtrippers/image/upload/c_fill,h_316,w_520/v1383058986/the-hewitt-house-leatherfaces-home-from-texas-chainsaw-massacre-03-526fce2a8e2fb59b71000887.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">The Hisil House:</a><br /> All the vegetation is dead. The trees are twisted around the house. On some nights the moon appears behind the house like a giant spotlight making the house shadow extends throughout the yard dark as the nightsky. As you approach the front door you notice that the windows cry blood and wood floor range groans of pain when you step on it. If you are lost in the shadows worse for you because you found hell.<br /> (I will leave the house interior for interpretation)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/X9pgz\" target=\"_blank\">The main spirit: </a><br /> He is a twisted corrupted violent spirit of pain and pleasure.<br /> His body is humanoid made of barbed wire. He has no limbs but he can walk pushing himself with his barbed wire arms/legs cutting the floor and the wall so that it can move.<br /> He is an extremely violent spirit but he will try to convince you to give your own body to his satisfaction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">With a bit of magic everything can be done.</span></span><br /> <b>All WoD gamelines wallpapers <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...all-nwod-games\" target=\"_blank\">here! </a></b></i></span></span><br /> <i><b>Choose your favorite or create your own!</b></i>","edited":{"userid":866,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/866-magisanctum","user":"magisanctum","date":". 06-16-2016, 01:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/866-magisanctum","name":"magisanctum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar866_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T03:04:34-07:00","id":948472,"title":"","content":"Ideas for wounds, glades and shoals?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">With a bit of magic everything can be done.</span></span><br /> <b>All WoD gamelines wallpapers <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...all-nwod-games\" target=\"_blank\">here! </a></b></i></span></